+## `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board and creates its secret public URL. Only account administrators can publish a board.
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board JSON. The `public_url` field contains the shareable, unscoped URL. Repeating this request keeps the existing URL.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board and revokes its current public URL. Only account administrators can unpublish a board.
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success. Republish creates a new secret URL.
+
+## Public board pages
+
+Published boards can be viewed without authentication at:
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:column_id`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+Only published cards are exposed by the public pages. Draft cards and revoked board URLs return `404 Not Found`.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
